          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu mwaka ogwamakumi asatu n'omwenda (39) nga Uzzia n'afuga Buyudaaya, Menahemu mutabane wa Gadi yaafuuka kyabazinga wa Isiraeli. Yaafugira mu Samaria okumala entangama ya myaka ikumi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaakola ebibi eri Musengwa Katonda, era enaku edh'obulamu bwe dhoonadhoona yaaloba kulekera okukola ebibi ng'ebya Yeroboamu mutabane wa Nebati, ebyaleetera Isiraeli okwonoona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Puli ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15:19",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Puli:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Oyo ni Tigulathi Pileseri (Owokusatu). 15:29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " kyabazinga w'e Siria, yaalumba Isiraeli. Menahemu yaagha Puli oyo kilo emitwalo amakumi asatu n'ena (340,000) edha feeza, olwo Puli oyo aghange okuyamba Menahemu okukakata ku bwakyabazinga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Empiiya edho dhe yagha kyabazinga w'e Siria, Menahemu yadhisoloza ku basaadha boonaboona abakombe ab'omu Isiraeli. Kiisi musaadha yaghaayo ebitundu amakumi ataanu ebya feeza. Agho Puli kyabazinga w'e Siria yaakyuka yairayo, yaaloba kusigala mu nsi eyo Isiraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
