        },
        {
          "text": "Mu mwaka ogwamakumi ataanu (50) nga kyabazinga Uzzia n'afuga Buyudaaya, Pekahia mutabane wa Menahemu yaafuuka kyabazinga wa Isiraeli. Yaafugira mu Samaria okumala entangama ya myaka ebiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaakola ebibi eri Musengwa Katonda nga Yeroboamu mutabane wa Nebati bye yakola, ebyaleetera Isiraeli okwonoona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho omuduumizi ow'eigye lye ayetebwa Peka, mutabane wa Remalia, yaakola olukwe n'abasaadha amakumi ataanu abaava e Gileadi, yaamwitira e Samaria mu kifo eky'okwewogomamu eky'omu kisaagaati kya kyabazinga. Olwo Peka oyo yaafuuka kyabazinga mu kifo kya Pekahia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
