        {
          "text": "Mu mwaka ogwamakumi abiri (20) nga kyabazinga Yothamu mutabane wa Uzzia n'afuga Buyudaaya, Hoshea mutabane wa Ela yaakola olukwe, yaafumita Peka mutabane wa Remalia, yaamwita. Olwo Hoshea oyo yaafuuka kyabazinga mu kifo kye.",
