          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu biseera Yothamu bye yafugiramu, Musengwa Katonda mwe yatoolereza okusindika Rezini kyabazinga wa Siria ni Peka kyabazinga wa Isiraeli era mutabane wa Remalia, baaja baalumba Buyudaaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Yothamu yaafa yeeyimba ku badhaadha be abaafa, era yaaziikibwa mu badhaadha be abo, mu kyetebwa Ekibuga kya Daudi dhaadha we. Mutabane we Ahazi yaamusikira ku bwakyabazinga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.38"
            ]
